      <title>About Me</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 19 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;about-me&#34;&gt;&#xA;  About Me&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#about-me&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Software Engineer and Trader passionate about technology and financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Background&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#background&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I specialize in developing trading systems and software solutions that bridge the gap between technology and financial markets. With extensive experience in both software engineering and trading, I bring a unique perspective to building robust, efficient trading systems.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;skills&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Skills&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#skills&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Software Engineering (Multiple Languages &amp;amp; Frameworks)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Algorithmic Trading&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Financial Markets Analysis&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;System Architecture&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Trading Strategy Development&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;contact&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Contact&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#contact&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Feel free to reach out to me on &lt;a href=&#34;https://twitter.com/piotryordanov&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/piotryordanov&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;GitHub&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
